{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05890","headline":"瓜园诗 · 王维","name":"瓜园诗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"余适欲锄瓜，倚锄听叩门。\n鸣驺导骢马，常从夹朱轩。\n穷巷正传呼，故人傥相存。\n携手追凉风，放心望乾坤。\n蔼蔼帝王州，宫观一何繁。\n林端出绮道，殿顶摇华幡。\n素怀在青山，若值白云屯。\n回风城西雨，返景原上村。\n前酌盈尊酒，往往闻清言。\n黄鹂啭深木，朱槿照中园。\n犹羡松下客，石上闻清猿。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王维","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05890.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05890","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}